# WorkOS API key for the Deploy spend-cap budget alerts (optional).
# Copy this to .env.workos to let the worker resolve an org's admin emails as
# the alert recipients. Without it the spend-cap check resolves no recipients
# and the alert just logs; enforcement (suspend/resume) is unaffected.
#
# Tilt also sources this file into the local dashboard. Agent signup stays
# disabled until the dashboard runs with AUTH_PROVIDER=workos and the four
# values below are set. Uncomment them when you enable the feature. Leave
# them commented to keep POST /api/agent/* and /auth.md returning 404.
WORKOS_API_KEY=sk_test_...
# WORKOS_CLIENT_ID=
# WORKOS_COOKIE_PASSWORD=
# WORKOS_AUTHKIT_DOMAIN=
# WORKOS_AGENT_AUDIENCE=
